sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant P as Portal / landing
  participant S as SSO
  participant G as Google OAuth
  participant ST as SSO_STATE_FILE

  U->>P: Open campus / portal
  P->>S: Redirect /login?returnUrl=…
  U->>S: Sign in with Google
  S->>S: Channel enabled?<br/>GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID + SECRET
  S->>G: /o/oauth2/v2/auth<br/>openid email profile + state
  G-->>U: Account picker
  U->>G: Consent
  G->>S: /v1/auth/channels/google/callback?code&state
  S->>G: Exchange code → access_token
  G-->>S: token
  S->>G: userinfo
  G-->>S: email + sub (verified)
  S->>ST: findPersonByEmail(email)
  alt Unknown or no roles
    S-->>U: /login?googleError=…
  else Invited person
    S->>S: Session + redirectAfterLogin
    S-->>U: returnUrl?code= or role picker
    U->>P: Exchange code / continue
  end
